comments.body:
@dhh Could you take a look at this when you have a moment?

It exposes live Image Picker state and remote cursor control over the existing image-selector IPC (state / setCursor / apply), with optional theme and background contexts. More context and the task write-up are here: https://app.basecamp.com/5994298/buckets/48688864/card_tables/cards/10262905397

Would love your feedback.
